    zh: '越界之爱的甜言最终变成苦味；智慧邀请我们把爱和喜悦，长久地留给自己所立约的人。',
    en: 'The sweet talk of love that crosses the line turns bitter in the end; wisdom invites us to keep our love and delight, for the long haul, with the one we’ve committed to.',
